                                "sense_id": "ab85a39b-abe8-3bbd-89eb-70d9cd52f2d3",
                                "text": "The 19th and 20th lines of the lex on the tablet (which decree the repeal of the rectigalia) seem to be conclusive in favour of this and against Rudorff's earlier theory."
